The Audi A8 D5 (2017-Present) is the most recent generation, with a facelift in 2021/2022. The SE trim is typically an entry-level luxury trim in the UK/Europe. I will base the evaluation on the 3.0L V6 TFSI (55 TFSI) or 3.0L V6 TDI (50 TDI) mild-hybrid engines, as these are common in the SE trim.

- **price_usd:** The 2025 Audi A8 starts around $93,295 USD. This is significantly above the market average. Score: -1.00.
